WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Barid-IN: all your tickets, in one place.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.600
Sign in to one shared workspace. Admin, HR and Employee roles.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.600
A live dashboard for every role. Open tickets, SLA, workload and recent activity.

4
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.600
Board and list views. Move between a ticket board and a sortable list.

5
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:21.100
Filter by status, priority, category and SLA. Open, unassigned, escalated, SLA breached and more.

6
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.600
My Workspace. Every ticket you raised, work on, watch or commented on.

7
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.100
Everything else is one menu away. Projects, people, reports, to-do, configuration.

8
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:34.100
Raise an incident in one form. Requester, category, priority and attachments.

9
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:39.100
Assign, reply and follow the status flow. New - Open - Assigned - In progress - Pending - Resolved - Closed.

10
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:43.600
Assignees accept, then update progress. Every step is recorded on the ticket.

11
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.100
Post a progress update and move the status. The requester and admins are notified.

12
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:52.600
Try the Live Demo.

